  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.wabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fzombiecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1395245/description_048ebfaf-e531-4528-93df-8d8597d8fa0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-turrets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tacz Turrets</a> 材質包翻新，專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/zombiecraft-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zombiecraft</a> 打造</p>\n<p>此材質包全面更新了砲塔材質，帶來更沉浸且細緻的遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此材質包亦可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/zombiecraft-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zombiecraft</a> 之外使用。</p>",
